# Tail Stall: straight up the vert ramp, I + down right at the coping (the direction only as it catches, so
# it barely spins): the stall (lip review: ./skate strip --sheet scenarios/lips.strips), let go: drop
# back in forward (the rider turned round on the coping).
park lab
spawn lab_vert
cmd 6 speed 10
hold grind 212..278
hold down+right 212..214
bot balance
run 600
expect event lipStart{trick=Tail Stall} within 210..220
expect event lipEnd{trick=Tail Stall,reason=drop in} within 276..282
expect event land{fakie=false} within 280..380
expect no event bail
